  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;&#x2018;Providing Specialized Gender Based Violence (GBV) Response Services and GBV Risk Mitigation in Tigray Region&#x2019;, project implemented by Tr&#xf3;caire/CST Ethiopia, aims to reduce suffering of crisis-affected individuals especially women and girls. It targets women and girls across 13 communities in Tigray region. Key activities include; provision of high quality, survivor centred GBV response services, psychosocial services, and community based psychosocial support (through the Adigrat Catholic Secretariat (ADCS)) and risk mitigation measures.</narrative>
  </description>
